        oracle_id: "5753f4d6-08d0-4e12-85c5-875ee6441626",
        source: "wotc",
        published_at: "2026-06-29",
        comment: "If you don't control an Army, the Goblin Army token you create enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature before receiving counters. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power enters the battlefield, such as that of Mentor of the Meek, will see the token enter as a 0/0 creature before it gets +1/+1 counters.",
