        oracle_id: "5753f4d6-08d0-4e12-85c5-875ee6441626",
        source: "wotc",
        published_at: "2026-06-29",
        comment: "In the rare case that you control multiple Army creatures (perhaps because you control a creature with changeling) while you amass Goblins, you choose which of your Army creatures to put the +1/+1 counters on. If that creature isn't a Goblin, it becomes a Goblin in addition to its other types.",
