        published_at: "2026-06-29",
        comment: "An effect may refer to a card, spell, or permanent that \"has an Adventure.\" This refers to a card, spell, or permanent that has an adventurer card's set of alternative characteristics, even if they're not being used and even if that card was never cast as an Adventure.",
