        oracle_id: "d05db2c1-a19a-4803-8e8a-fa2f9b798181",
        source: "wotc",
        published_at: "2026-06-29",
        comment: "Because Bard, King of Dale is legendary, it's unlikely that one player will control two. However, if that happens, cards drawn by that player will be multiplied by four. Three Bards will multiply by eight, and so on.",
