        comment: "As an effect causes a creature with a prepare spell to become prepared (including effects that state that a creature \"enters prepared\"), that creature's controller creates a copy of that creature's prepare spell in exile. That copy remains in exile for as long as that permanent is on the battlefield and is prepared. That creature's controller may cast that copy as long as it remains in exile. As they cast it, that creature stops being prepared.",
