        source: "wotc",
        published_at: "2026-03-20",
        comment: "A preparation card is a creature card in every zone. For example, while it's in your graveyard, Emeritus of Ideation is a blue creature whose mana value is 5. It can't be the target of Zealous Lorecaster's triggered ability (\"When this creature enters, return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand.\").",
