        oracle_id: "6cb8b8c4-0674-4f14-9d89-010969fbb80e",
        source: "wotc",
        published_at: "2026-03-20",
        comment: "If a prepared creature stops being a creature, it will still be prepared, and the copy of its prepare spell will remain in exile. That permanent's controller will still be able to cast it. The same is true if a prepared creature becomes a copy of something else, even if it's then a permanent without a prepare spell.",
