        source: "wotc",
        published_at: "2025-10-02",
        comment: "Triggered abilities use the word \"when,\" \"whenever,\" or \"at.\" They're often written as \"[Trigger condition], [effect].\" Some keyword abilities, such as prowess, are triggered abilities and will have \"when,\" \"whenever,\" or \"at\" in their reminder text.",
